<resources>
    <string name="tagline">A metal detector that is honest about what it finds: screws, nails, studs and magnets.</string>
    <string name="note_honest">magnr measures the magnetic field. It finds iron, steel, nickel and magnets. It cannot find gold, silver, copper or aluminium, because they are not magnetic.</string>
    <string name="note_sensor">The sensor sits inside the phone, usually near the top. Phone sensors are not measuring instruments and values can drift.</string>

